“In conclusion, MedCare provides a simple, centralized, and efficient solution for managing hospital activities digitally. It helps manage patient information, doctors, appointments, medical records, prescriptions, and billing in one platform. By using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Node.js, Express.js, and MongoDB, the system reduces manual record management and makes information easier to access and organize. Overall, MedCare demonstrates how technology can make hospital management more systematic, efficient, and user-friendly.
